11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Forsaken is a 2015 revisionist Western film directed by Jon
Cassar, from a screenplay by Brad Mirman.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The film stars Kiefer Sutherland, Donald Sutherland, Brian Cox,
Michael Wincott, Aaron Poole and Demi Moore.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The film had its world premiere at the Toronto
International Film Festival on September 16, 2015.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The film was released on February 19, 2016.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
One of the executive producers on the film was Doug Falconer.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The film explores themes of small town, gunslinger, saloon, gang, shootout.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The tone is emotional.
